# Large test-vector logs are stored in Git LFS. The pattern is recursive so it
# keeps matching after the spxhash tree was restructured into v1/ and v2/
# (the previous non-recursive path let a 149 MB log be committed as a plain
# blob, which GitHub rejects on push).
src/spxhash/**/testvc/test_output.log filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
